cate)**: Missions 54, 55, & 56 (*Top Billing* $\\rightarrow$ *Boobie Time* $\\rightarrow$ *First Impressions*).\n193:   3. **Strand 3: Raul Bautista & Randy (Cartel Logistics & Cars)**: Missions 53, 57, 58, 59, & 60 (*Car Service* $\\rightarrow$ *Caught Slipping* $\\rightarrow$ *Crosstown Traffic* $\\rightarrow$ *Credit Check* $\\rightarrow$ *Steal Zorrusso for Randy*).\n194: - **Convergence at Heist Scope Out (M61)**: All 3 strands converge into *Sinfrontera National Bank*.\n195: - **The 3 Concurrent Heist Preparation Tracks**: Scope out unlocks the heist planning board, distributing prep work into 3 simultaneous tracks:\n196:   - **Track 1: Safecracker Pipeline**: *62. Security Expert* (Nicole Park) $\\rightarrow$ *65. Safe Word* (Drill) $\\rightarrow$ *68. Cooties* (Disinfection).\n197:   - **Track 2: Explosives Pipeline**: *63. Company Property* (Charges) $\\rightarrow$ *66. Hidden Charges* (Cell Towers) $\\rightarrow$ *69. Bricked Up* (Armor Route).\n198:   - **Track 3: Codes & Van Pipeline**: *64. The Missing Link* (Monty Interrogation) $\\rightarrow$ *67. Ride or Die* (Armored Van).\n199: - **The Heist Finale (M70)**: *The Cartel Heist* ($10.5M Take). \n200: - **CRITICAL SPEEDRUN REQUIREMENT**: Runners **MUST retain at least $75,000 cash** in their BuckMe account to clear Abe Gonzalez's mandatory wire gate in Chapter 4!\n201: \n202: ```mermaid\n203: flowchart TD\n204:     C2_Trans[\"From Ch. 2: Checking Out\"] --> M45[\"45. Welcome to Vice City\"]\n205:     M45 --> M46[\"46. Dealer's Choice\"]\n206:     M46 --> M47[\"47. Meet the Heders\"]\n207:     M47 --> M48[\"48. Dubious Provenance\"]\n208:     M48 --> M49[\"49. Mami Knows Best\"]\n209:     M49 --> M50[\"50. South Leonida Real Estate<br/>(Vice City Safehouse Unlocked)\"]\n210:     \n211:     M50 --> S1[\"Strand 1: Tyrone (Muscle)\"]\n212:     M50 --> S2[\"Strand 2: Boobie & Dre (Syndicate)\"]\n213:     M50 --> S3[\"Strand 3: Raul & Randy (Cartel & Cars)\"]\n214:     \n215:     subgraph Strands[\"3 Concurrent Faction Strands\"]\n216:         subgraph Strand_1[\"Strand 1\"]\n217:             S1[\"51. Tyrone\"] --> M52[\"52. Here, Kitty Kitty\"]\n218:         end\n219:         subgraph Strand_2[\"Strand 2\"]\n220:             S2[\"54. Top Billing\"] --> M55[\"55. Boobie Time\"]\n221:             M55 --> M56[\"56. First Impressions\"]\n222:         end\n223:         subgraph Strand_3[\"Strand 3\"]\n224:             S3[\"53. Car Service\"] --> M57[\"57. Caught Slipping\"]\n225:             M57 --> M58[\"58. Crosstown Traffic\"]\n226:             M58 --> M59[\"59. Credit Check\"]\n227:             M59 --> M60[\"60. Steal Zorrusso for Randy\"]\n228:         end\n229:     end\n230:     \n231:     M52 & M56 & M60 --> M61[\"61. Sinfrontera National Bank<br/>★ ALL 3 STRANDS CONVERGE HERE ★<br/>(Heist Scope Out & Board Unlocked)\"]\n232:     \n233:     subgraph Heist_Pipeline[\"Sinfrontera Bank Heist Prep (3 Concurrent Tracks)\"]\n234:         direction TB\n235:         subgraph T1[\"Track 1: Safecracker\"]\n236:             P62[\"62. Security Expert<br/>(Nicole Park)\"] --> P65[\"65. Safe Word<br/>(Safe-Cracking Drill)\"]\n237:             P65 --> P68[\"68. Cooties<br/>(Disinfection)\"]\n238:         end\n239:         subgraph T2[\"Track 2: Explosives\"]\n240:             P63[\"63. Company Property<br/>(Vault Charges)\"] --> P66[\"66. Hidden Charges<br/>(Rig 3 Towers)\"]\n241:             P66 --> P69[\"69. Bricked Up<br/>(Reinforce Route)\"]\n242:         end\n243:         subgraph T3[\"Track 3: Codes & Van\"]\n244:             P64[\"64. The Missing Link<br/>(Monty Interrogation)\"] --> P67[\"67. Ride or Die<br/>(Armored Van)\"]\n245:         end\n246:     end\n247:     \n248:     M61 ==>|\"Top Distribution Bus\"| P62\n249:     M61 ==>|\"Top Distribution Bus\"| P63\n250:     M61 ==>|\"Top Distribution Bus\"| P64\n251:     \n252:     P68 & P69 & P67 --> M70[\"70. THE CARTEL HEIST<br/>★ MAJOR HEIST CLIMAX ★<br/>($10.5M Vault Raid Take)<br/>⚠️ KEEP $75k FOR CHAPTER 4 ABE GATE ⚠️\"]\n253:     \n254:     M70 -->|\"Hard Transition\"| C4_Start[\"→ Chapter 4: Ocean Beach Safehouse\"]\n255: ```\n256: \n257: ---\n258: \n259: ## 5. Chapter 4: Vice City Metro & Airport Takedown\n260: \n261: ### Mechanics & Structure\n262: - **Scope**: 25 main missions (M71 through M95).\n263: - **Safehouse**: Y Hotel (Ocean Beach headquarters).\n264: - **Mandatory Cash Gate (M75)**: In *Party Hard*, corrupt lawyer Abe Gonzalez demands a mandatory **$75,000 BuckMe wire transfer** to proceed.\n265: - **Strict Chronological Sequence**:\n266:   - **Stage 1: Beachhead & Abe Gate (M71–M75)**: Establishing Ocean Beach lifestyle and securing legal immunity.\n267:   - **Stage 2: Syndicate Operations (M76–M82)**: Harbor smuggling, blackmail photography, fitness front extortion, and body sanitization.\n268:   - **Stage 3: Dre'Quan Climax & Airport Recon (M83–M91)**: Celebrity protection, kidnapping, Dre'Quan concert finale (*Headliners*), and VCIA airport perimeter surveillance.\n269:   - **Stage 4: Airport Heist & Evacuation (M92–M95)**: Cargo infiltration (*Fully Catered*), the massive airport heist (*VCIA Takedown*), open-world lockdown (*Sunset*), and emergency evacuation (*Starting From Zero*).\n270: - **POINT OF NO RETURN**: *\"Sunset\"* permanently locks open-world activities and free roam saves, forcing continuous progression into Chapter 5.\n271: \n272: ```mermaid\n273: flowchart TD\n274:     C3_Trans[\"From Ch. 3: The Cartel Heist\"] --> S1_Start\n275:     \n276:     subgraph C4_S1[\"Stage 1: Beachhead & $75k Gate (M71 - M75)\"]\n277:         S1_Start[\"71. Ocean Beach<br/>(Y Hotel Safehouse)\"] --> M72[\"72. Another Life\"]\n278:         M72 --> M73[\"73. Company Cars\"]\n279:         M73 --> M74[\"74. Lawyer Up<br/>(Abe Gonzalez Consultation)\"]\n280:         M74 --> M75[\"75. Party Hard<br/>⚠️ MANDATORY $75,000 BUCKME WIRE ⚠️\"]\n281:     end\n282:     \n283:     M75 -->|\"Stage 1 Complete\"| S2_Start\n284:     \n285:     subgraph C4_S2[\"Stage 2: Syndicate Ops (M76 - M82)\"]\n286:         S2_Start[\"76. Heavy Lifting<br/>(Container Smuggling)\"] --> M77[\"77. Photo/Shoot\"]\n287:         M77 --> M78[\"78. Making Gainz\"]\n288:         M78 --> M79[\"79. Watch It\"]\n289:         M79 --> M80[\"80. Cash Injections\"]\n290:         M80 --> M81[\"81. Amateur Hour\"]\n291:         M81 --> M82[\"82. Dirty Work<br/>(Sanitizing Murder Scene)\"]\n292:     end\n293:     \n294:     M82 -->|\"Stage 2 Complete\"| S3_Start\n295:     \n296:     subgraph C4_S3[\"Stage 3: Dre'Quan Climax & Airport Recon (M83 - M91)\"]\n297:         S3_Start[\"83. Too Much Baggage<br/>(Airport Courier Recon)\"] --> M84[\"84. Adventures in Babysitting\"]\n298:         M84 --> M85[\"85. Fresh Evidence\"]\n299:         M85 --> M86[\"86. Power Play\"]\n300:         M86 --> M87[\"87. Child's Play\"]\n301:         M87 --> M88[\"88. Headliners<br/>(Dre'Quan Syndicate Climax)\"]\n302:         M88 --> M89[\"89. Close Surveillance -> 91. Team Building<br/>(VCIA Perimeter Intel)\"]\n303:     end\n304:     \n305:     M89 -->|\"Stage 3 Complete\"| S4_Start\n306:     \n307:     subgraph C4_S4[\"Stage 4: VCIA Heist & Evacuation (M92 - M95)\"]\n308:         S4_Start[\"92. Fully Catered<br/>(Catering Van Smuggling)\"] --> M93[\"93. VCIA TAKEDOWN<br/>★ MAJOR AIRPORT CARGO HEIST ★\"]\n309:         M93 --> M94[\"94. Sunset<br/>🚨 POINT OF NO RETURN 🚨<br/>(Open-World Roaming Locked)\"]\n310:         M94 --> M95[\"95. Starting From Zero<br/>(Chapter 4 Climax Evacuation)\"]\n311:     end\n312:     \n313:     M95 -->|\"Hard Transition\"| C5_Start[\"→ Chapter 5: Top of the World\"]\n314: ```\n315: \n316: ---\n317: \n318: ## 6. Chapter 5: Top of the World, Ma! (Climax & Branching Endings)\n319: \n320: ### Mechanics & Structure\n321: - **Scope**: 7 explosive endgame operations (M96 through M102).\n322: - **The Standoff Decision (Mission 100)**: At the Key West Motel, Agent Mendez surrounds Jason and Lucia, triggering the critical campaign finale fork:\n323:   - **Ending A: Bonnie & Clyde (Canonical Partner Loyalty)**:\n324:     - Jason and Lucia reject the federal plea and fight side-by-side against Mendez's tactical strike teams.\n325:     - Requires fighting through an extended multi-stage offshore Coast Guard gunboat pursuit to reach an airstrip.\n326:     - **Reward**: **Awards a $2,000,000 completion payout** into the player's account. (*Note: $2M is an earned reward, NOT a requirement to start!*)\n327:   - **Ending B: The Deal (⚡ ANY% SPEEDRUN ROUTE ⚡)**:\n328:     - One partner accepts Agent Mendez's federal immunity agreement.\n329:     - **Bypasses the entire multi-stage offshore boat chase**, saving **8 to 12 minutes of real-world runner time**.\n330:   - **Ending C: The Sacrifice (Partner Separation)**:\n331:     - One partner acts as bait while the other evacuates solo to South America. Triggers unique melancholy post-game radio commentary.\n332: - **Epilogue & Free Roam Restored (M101–M102)**: Free roam across the entire Leonida map is unlocked following the credits.\n333: \n334: ```mermaid\n335: flowchart TD\n336:     C4_Trans[\"From Ch. 4: Starting From Zero\"] --> M96[\"96. Top of the World<br/>(Keys Sanctuary Infiltration)\"]\n337:     M96 --> M97[\"97. Bait and Switch<br/>(Luring Federal Strike Teams)\"]\n338:     M97 --> M98[\"98. Scorched Earth<br/>(Asset Evacuation)\"]\n339:     M98 --> M99[\"99. Two Hundred Percent<br/>(Joint Assault on Mendez Compound)\"]\n340:     \n341:     M99 --> M100[\"100. FINAL DECISION STANDOFF<br/>(Key West Motel Ambush by Agent Mendez)\"]\n342:     \n343:     M100 -->|\"Loyalty Path\"| EA[\"Ending A: Bonnie & Clyde<br/>★ Canonical Ending ★<br/>- Reject Federal Plea<br/>- Multi-stage Coast Guard Boat Battle<br/>★ AWARDS $2,000,000 CASH PAYOUT ★\"]\n344:     \n345:     M100 ==>|\"⚡ Speedrun Route ⚡\"| EB[\"Ending B: The Deal<br/>★ FASTEST ANY% ENDING ★<br/>- Accept Mendez Immunity<br/>- Completely Skips Boat Chase<br/>★ SAVES 8 - 12 MINUTES ★\"]\n346:     \n347:     M100 -->|\"Tragic Path\"| EC[\"Ending C: The Sacrifice<br/>- Partner Separation<br/>- Solo South America Flight<br/>- Melancholy Post-Game Radio\"]\n348:     \n349:     EA --> M101[\"101. Final Evacuation -> 102. Epilogue & Credits\"]\n350:     EB --> M101\n351:     EC --> M101\n352:     \n353:     M101 --> END[\"★ FULL LEONIDA FREE ROAM RESTORED ★\"]\n354: ```\n355: \n356: ---\n357: \n358: ## 7. Prerequisite & Unlock Reference Matrix (Build 1.0.2.1 Ground Truth)\n359: \n360: | Chapter | Mission Title (Exact 0DRP) | Internal ID | Protagonist & Trigger Window | Mandatory Prerequisite | Unlocked Feature / Story Consequence | Speedrun Advisory |\n361: | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n362: | **Ch. 1** | **1. Prologue** | `INT_PROLO` | Lucia | Game Launch | Introduces Lucia in Hamlet Penitentiary interview | Unskippable intro cutscene |\n363: | **Ch. 1** | **2. Gone Fishing** | `INT_CHASE` | Jason | 1. Prologue | Petty smuggling; splits story into 3 concurrent branches | Grab $140 mailbox immediately |\n364: | **Ch. 1** | **3. Unwanted Attention** | `COM_KBOS_COLAT` | Jason | 2. Gone Fishing | Cal Hamlet trip; recovers car from impound | **ANY% SKIP** (Auto-flagged by `MTL_WAKE`) |\n365: | **Ch. 1** | **4. Pipework** | `COM_KBOS_NEIGHB` | Jason | 3. Unwanted Attention | Mandy rent collection & home plumbing repairs | **ANY% SKIP** (Auto-flagged by `MTL_WAKE`) |\n366: | **Ch. 1** | **5. Gear Up** | `FT_AMUCO` | Jason | 2. Gone Fishing | Picks up longarm gun at Ammu-Nation | Mandatory Branch 2 prerequisite |\n367: | **Ch. 1** | **6. Just a Scratch** | `FT_KMODSHP` | Jason | 5. Gear Up | Ganado repair & respray; **MANDATORY STORY GATE** | Complete early to prevent Joey reroute call |\n368: | **Ch. 1** | **7. Lab Fees** | `COM_KBOS_SHOP` | Jason | 2. Gone Fishing | Acid front boutique rent collection | **ANY% SKIP** (Auto-flagged by `MTL_WAKE`) |\n369: | **Ch. 1** | **8. Hey Arnold!** | `COM_KBOS_RADR` | Jason (08:00–16:00) | 7. Lab Fees | Tracks down cargo broker Arnold | **ANY% SKIP** (A